---
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor SDD_SEQ_08_Employee as Employee
  participant SDD_SEQ_08_UI as Baseline UI
  participant SDD_SEQ_08_Start as Start/read service
  participant SDD_SEQ_08_Answer as Answer / submit services
  participant SDD_SEQ_08_Finalize as AdaptiveAttemptFinalizationService
  participant SDD_SEQ_08_DB as Transactional<br/>attempt/evidence store
  participant SDD_SEQ_08_Policy as Pinned policy/content and<br/>catalog ports
  SDD_SEQ_08_Employee->>SDD_SEQ_08_UI: start or resume
  SDD_SEQ_08_UI->>SDD_SEQ_08_Start: command key and selection-bound intent
  SDD_SEQ_08_Start->>SDD_SEQ_08_DB: authorize, learner coordination, replay/resume check
  alt existing own resumable attempt
  SDD_SEQ_08_DB-->>SDD_SEQ_08_Start: retained snapshot
  else eligible new admission
  SDD_SEQ_08_Start->>SDD_SEQ_08_Policy: validate current scope and feasible resources
  SDD_SEQ_08_Start->>SDD_SEQ_08_DB: pin versions/pool/content/deadline and first item
  end
  SDD_SEQ_08_Start-->>SDD_SEQ_08_UI: safe current item, no answer key
  SDD_SEQ_08_Employee->>SDD_SEQ_08_UI: answer
  SDD_SEQ_08_UI->>SDD_SEQ_08_Answer: item position + revision + key/body
  SDD_SEQ_08_Answer->>SDD_SEQ_08_DB: lock attempt, validate replay/revision
  SDD_SEQ_08_Answer->>SDD_SEQ_08_Policy: score and evaluate pinned adaptive policy
  SDD_SEQ_08_Answer->>SDD_SEQ_08_DB: store response/progress
  alt terminal condition or confirmed submit
  SDD_SEQ_08_Answer->>SDD_SEQ_08_Finalize: evaluate terminal policy
  SDD_SEQ_08_Finalize->>SDD_SEQ_08_Policy: load original technical pins
  SDD_SEQ_08_Finalize->>SDD_SEQ_08_DB: compare actual progress, persist terminal outcome
  SDD_SEQ_08_DB->>SDD_SEQ_08_DB: valid result/evidence/profile or explicit<br/>invalidation
  else continue
  SDD_SEQ_08_Answer->>SDD_SEQ_08_DB: persist next pinned item
  end
  SDD_SEQ_08_Answer-->>SDD_SEQ_08_UI: committed outcome
  SDD_SEQ_08_Employee->>SDD_SEQ_08_UI: open result / mastery
  SDD_SEQ_08_UI->>SDD_SEQ_08_DB: via authorized read use case
  SDD_SEQ_08_DB-->>SDD_SEQ_08_UI: safe own result/provenance
